<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Birthday My Nobita ❤️</title>

<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
 margin:0;
 min-height:100vh;
 font-family:Georgia,serif;
 overflow:hidden;
 background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffd6e7,#fff1c7,#e2d5ff);
 text-align:center;
 color:#5b2149;
}
.page{
 min-height:100vh;
 display:flex;
 justify-content:center;
 align-items:center;
 padding:25px;
}
.card{
 width:min(92%,500px);
 padding:35px 25px;
 border-radius:30px;
 background:rgba(255,255,255,.72);
 box-shadow:0 10px 40px rgba(100,40,80,.2);
 animation:appear 1.5s ease;
}
h1{
 font-size:38px;
 margin:5px 0 15px;
 animation:pulse 2s infinite;
}
h2{font-size:27px}
p{
 font-size:19px;
 line-height:1.7;
}
.cake{
 font-size:75px;
 animation:bounce 1.5s infinite;
}
button{
 border:0;
 border-radius:30px;
 padding:14px 25px;
 font-size:17px;
 background:#ff6f9f;
 color:white;
 cursor:pointer;
 margin-top:15px;
}
.hidden{display:none}
.balloon{
 position:fixed;
 bottom:-100px;
 font-size:45px;
 animation:float 7s linear infinite;
}
.b1{left:8%;animation-delay:0s}
.b2{left:25%;animation-delay:2s}
.b3{left:50%;animation-delay:1s}
.b4{left:72%;animation-delay:3s}
.b5{left:90%;animation-delay:4s}

.heart{
 position:fixed;
 font-size:25px;
 animation:heart 5s linear infinite;
}
.h1{left:15%;bottom:-30px}
.h2{left:80%;bottom:-30px;animation-delay:2s}

@keyframes float{
 0%{transform:translateY(0) rotate(-8deg);opacity:0}
 15%{opacity:1}
 100%{transform:translateY(-115vh) rotate(15deg);opacity:0}
}
@keyframes heart{
 0%{transform:translateY(0);opacity:0}
 20%{opacity:1}
 100%{transform:translateY(-100vh);opacity:0}
}
@keyframes appear{
 from{opacity:0;transform:scale(.7)}
 to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)}
}
@keyframes bounce{
 50%{transform:translateY(-12px)}
}
@keyframes pulse{
 50%{transform:scale(1.04)}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="balloon b1">🎈</div>
<div class="balloon b2">🎈</div>
<div class="balloon b3">🎈</div>
<div class="balloon b4">🎈</div>
<div class="balloon b5">🎈</div>

<div class="heart h1">❤️</div>
<div class="heart h2">💗</div>

<div class="page">
<div class="card">

<div class="cake">🎂</div>

<h1>Happiest Birthday ❤️</h1>
<h2>My Nobita 💕</h2>

<p>
I love you so, so much, my Nobita. ❤️
</p>

<button onclick="showMessage()">Open Your Surprise 💌</button>

<div id="message" class="hidden">

<p>
I want to spend my whole life with you,
making beautiful memories together. 🥹❤️
</p>

<p>
You are very special to me.
Thank you for being a part of my life,
for making me smile and for being my comfort. 🌸
</p>

<p>
I hope we keep choosing each other,
laughing together, irritating each other,
supporting each other and making countless
beautiful memories. ✨
</p>

<h2>Happy Birthday, My Love! 🎂❤️</h2>

<p>
May your life always be filled with happiness,
success, love and lots of beautiful moments. 🌷
</p>

<p>Forever and always… ❤️</p>

</div>

</div>
</div>

<script>
function showMessage(){
 document.getElementById("message").classList.remove("hidden");
 document.querySelector("button").style.display="none";

 for(let i=0;i<25;i++){
   let h=document.createElement("div");
   h.innerHTML="❤️";
   h.style.position="fixed";
   h.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";
   h.style.top="-30px";
   h.style.fontSize=(15+Math.random()*25)+"px";
   h.style.animation="heart 4s linear forwards";
   document.body.appendChild(h);
 }
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
